{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/pulls/898","id":1494309678,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAZNrFs5ZEVsu","html_url":"https://github.com/Ultimaker/Uranium/pull/898","diff_url":"https://github.com/Ultimaker/Uranium/pull/898.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Ultimaker/Uranium/pull/898.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/issues/898","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/pulls/898/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/pulls/898/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/issues/898/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/statuses/506d731c5ea6a54efa8c8223f8a787ed59385eca","number":898,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Refactor object reload to handle 3mf files","user":{"login":"pietchaki","id":6844712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NDQ3MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6844712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki","html_url":"https://github.com/pietchaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pietchaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n# Description\r\n\r\nWhen a 3MF file that has multiple models inside is loaded, Cura will alert if the file has been modified and asks if the user wants to reload id. When that happen, all objects from that file where being replaced by the first model in the file.\r\nAnother minor issue was that when reloading, Cura would read the same file multiple times, one for each model.\r\n\r\n! Important: This PR Requires https://github.com/Ultimaker/Cura/pull/16610\r\n\r\n## Type of change\r\n\r\n- [X] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n\r\n# How Has This Been Tested?\r\n\r\n- Confirmed other filetypes where not affected by the refactor:\r\n- Opened a OBJ file and reloaded.\r\n- Opened STL file and reloaded.\r\n- Opened gcode file, and reloaded.\r\n\r\n- Loaded a 3MF file with multiple models into Cura, verified the name of the models in the app are the model name in the file.\r\n- Updated the 3MF file changing the mesh for the models but keeping the names. Clicked the message asking to reload the file and confirmed meshes are updated.\r\n- Updated the 3MF file removing one of the models, clicked the message asking to reload and confirmed it works as before and keep the mesh in the scene.\r\n- Updated the 3MF file, adding a new mesh into it, clicked the message asking to reload and confirmed it works as before and the new mesh is NOT loaded in the scene{1}. \r\n\r\n{1}: This should be an improvement, as the newly added model should be loaded when we reload a file. However I couldn't find a simple way to do that at the moment and will try to fix it in a later improvement.\r\n\r\n**Test Configuration**:\r\n* Operating System: Windows 10\r\n\r\n# Checklist:\r\n\r\n- [X] My code follows the style guidelines of this project as described in [UltiMaker Meta](https://github.com/Ultimaker/Meta) and [Cura QML best practices](https://github.com/Ultimaker/Cura/wiki/QML-Best-Practices)\r\n- [X] I have read the [Contribution guide](https://github.com/Ultimaker/Cura/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) \r\n- [X] I have commented my code, particularly in hard-to-understand areas\r\n- [ ] I have uploaded any files required to test this change\r\n","labels":[{"id":4858349595,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAZNrFs8AAAABIZSIGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ultimaker/Uranium/labels/PR:%20Community%20Contribution%20:crown:","name":"PR: Community Contribution :crown:","description":"Community Contribution PR's","color":"E0EE4A","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2023-08-29T19:36:58Z","updated_at":"2023-11-01T13:53:35Z","closed_at":"2023-11-01T13:53:35Z","merged_at":"2023-11-01T13:53:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"d6a63ca2837bf934fa01aa0d41f235323e8ebc9e","assignee":{"login":"saumyaj3","id":70144862,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTQ0ODYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70144862?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3","html_url":"https://github.com/saumyaj3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"saumyaj3","id":70144862,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTQ0ODYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70144862?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3","html_url":"https://github.com/saumyaj3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saumyaj3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h